        "calls": 3,
        "text": "Freebuff stopped accepting self-reported usage signals from advertisers for sponsored coding tasks, shifting that verification to the platform's own internal checks. The company also defined a new minimum monthly spend floor for these specific ad contracts, a figure that is currently in place but not yet actively enforced by a visible system. This is an internal adjustment to how advertising performance is tracked and priced, so you will see no changes in your daily use of the coding assistant.",
        "at": "2026-10-28T00:22:57.852Z",
        "src": "cf868393864e"
      }
    },
