        "summary": "The sponsored account step in the CLI and shared ad subsystem now supports free-text user replies instead of a hard 'No' option, with `labSignupReplyText` capping input to 500 characters and `labSignupRepliedNote` instructing the agent to act on the reply as data. In `common/src/ads/sponsored-proposal-view.ts`, two new exports, `sponsoredCurrentStep` and `sponsoredStepStatusLine`, provide a formatted 'Step N of M' status string for minimized proposal cards, falling back to an offer plan count when individual step states are not yet reported.",
