        "text": "When the assistant pauses during a sponsored setup to ask you to sign in, you can now type a free-form message instead of only choosing between a confirmation and a decline. This allows you to explain a specific problem or request further help directly to the assistant. Additionally, a new progress line now appears on minimized sponsored task cards, showing exactly which step of the process is currently active. These changes affect anyone using the free coding assistant who accepts a sponsored offer, making the sign-in step more flexible and the task progress clearer.",
